{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\"\n       xmlns:event=\"https://github.com/stateforward/scxml.rs/namespaces/event\"\n       version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"orderSchema\" expr=\"({type: 'object'})\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"order\" target=\"done\"\n                event:schema='{\"type\": \"object\"}' event:schemaexpr=\"orderSchema\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml086-event-schema-and-schemaexpr.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml086-event-schema-and-schemaexpr.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":31,"byteOffset":383,"endColumn":81,"endLine":9,"startColumn":50,"startLine":9},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove `event:schemaexpr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml086-event-schema-and-schemaexpr.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":81,"endLine":9,"startColumn":51,"startLine":9}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<transition>` has both `event:schema` and `event:schemaexpr`\n\n**Note:** as with SCXML's other attribute/`expr` pairs, an element gives its schema either literally (`event:schema`) or as an expression (`event:schemaexpr`), not both\n\n**Help:** keep one of the two attributes","text":"`<transition>` has both `event:schema` and `event:schemaexpr`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":414,"start":384},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the schema is given here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml086-event-schema-and-schemaexpr.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":50,"endLine":9,"startColumn":17,"startLine":9}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML086"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"as with SCXML's other attribute and `expr` pairs (`event` and `eventexpr`, `target` and `targetexpr`), an element gives its schema either literally or as an expression whose value is the schema, not both"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: keep one of the two attributes.\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML086` for examples."},"id":"SCXML086","name":"SCXML086","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an element gives both `event:schema` and `event:schemaexpr`"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}